      <mxCell id="bronze" value="🪣 S3: Bronze Layer&#xa;s3://project-intelligent-bronze/&#xa;&#xa;• Apache Parquet format&#xa;• Append-only snapshots&#xa;• IAM Object Lock (GOVERNANCE)&#xa;• Partition: source/symbol/date&#xa;• Immutable audit trail" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE9E7;strokeColor=#BF360C;fontColor=#BF360C;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
