      <mxCell id="silver" value="🪣 S3: Silver Layer (Iceberg)&#xa;s3://project-intelligent-silver/&#xa;&#xa;• Apache Iceberg table format&#xa;• AWS Glue Catalog&#xa;• Dedup + null management&#xa;• Adjusted price&#xa;• Cap tier + market_context&#xa;• Snapshot versioning (G2 gate)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#546E7A;fontColor=#37474F;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
